# Angular dist bundle — built locally via `cd frontend && ng build`, packaged into
# the JAR by mvn process-resources. Tracking it caused git to show 50+ deletes per
# build (chunk hash rotation) and confused code-review tooling. Anyone building
# the JAR runs ng build first.
/src/main/resources/static/angular/**
/uploads/**
token.properties
machine-id.properties
localxpose.pid

